---
import AboutLayout from "../layouts/AboutLayout.astro";
import EmailObfuscated from "../components/EmailObfuscated";

const frontmatter = {
  title: "Get in Touch"
};
---

<AboutLayout frontmatter={frontmatter}>
  <img src="/cdh-contact-pic.jpeg" alt="Charles Hood" class="about-bio-image" style="float: right; margin: -60px 0 10px 10px; border-radius: 50%; width: 150px; height: 150px; object-fit: cover; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);"/>

  <style>
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .about-bio-image {
      width: 200px !important;
      height: 200px !important;
      margin-top: -72px !important;
    }
  }
  </style>

  <p>Hello there! 👋 I'd love to hear from you. Whether you have questions, suggestions, or just want to say hi, feel free to reach out.</p>

  <h2>Follow me on X 🐦</h2>
  <p>The best way to stay in touch is through X. Follow <a href="https://twitter.com/charleshood">@charleshood</a> for tech insights, music recommendations, and random observations.</p>

  <h2>Connect on LinkedIn 💼</h2>
  <p>For professional inquiries or to connect on a more formal platform, visit my <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/charleshood/">LinkedIn profile</a>. Let's build our professional network!</p>

  <h2>Find me on Facebook <span style="background-color: #1877F2; color: white; font-weight: bold; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; display: inline-block; line-height: 1;">f</span></h2>
  <p>Yeah, I still use <a href="https://www.facebook.com/charleshood">Facebook</a>. I'm in my 50s, what did you expect? 😄</p>

  <h2>Drop Me an Email 📬</h2>
  <p>Have a more detailed inquiry or just prefer email? Reach me at <EmailObfuscated client:load user="charles.hood" domain="gmail.com" />.</p>
</AboutLayout>